@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Bibliographic lookup - both sources enabled
actor Librarian
participant BibliographicController as API
participant BibliographicRegistrationService as Registration
participant BibliographicService as Service
participant GoogleBooksAdapter as Google
participant OpenLibraryAdapter as Open
participant BibliographicMerge as Merge
participant CatalogueMatcher as Catalogue
Librarian -> API : GET /api/bibliographic/{isbn}
API -> Registration : preview(isbn)
Registration -> Service : retrieve(isbn)
Service -> Google : lookupByIsbn(isbn)
Google --> Service : SourceOutcome
Service -> Open : lookupByIsbn(isbn)
Open --> Service : SourceOutcome
Service -> Merge : combine(isbn, all outcomes)
Merge --> Service : LookupResult (data, outcomes, warnings)
Service --> Registration : LookupResult
Registration -> Catalogue : resolve(data, empty overrides)
Catalogue --> Registration : CatalogueResolution (suggestions, needs)
Registration --> API : Preview(lookup, catalogue)
API --> Librarian : Metadata, warnings and completion needs
note over Registration,Catalogue : Lookup does not save a book or create authors/genres.
@enduml
